## Verified shopping facts

- Second-hand clothing pages use real photos of the exact item offered for sale, not generic catalogue photos.
- Condition, ticket status, size and inspection notes are shown only when confirmed for that item.
- Most pieces are limited; a `1/1` label should be interpreted only when Shopify inventory confirms one unit.
- Delivery costs 20 MAD inside Marrakech (choose the local delivery option at checkout) and 50 MAD elsewhere in Morocco; it is free for orders of 500 MAD or more.{% comment %} 2026-10-02, confirmed by the owner: inside Marrakech delivery is 20 MAD through Shopify LOCAL DELIVERY (not a shipping rate, which is why the delivery profile shows the old Marrakech shipping rate as inactive); everywhere else 50 MAD («Livraison Maroc»); free from 500 MAD. Do not rewrite this to a single 50 MAD rate. {% endcomment %}
- Cash on delivery (COD) and PayPal are available payment methods.
- Delivery time is not published as a fixed number: it depends on the city and the carrier and is confirmed on WhatsApp before dispatch. Review scores, customer counts, awards and certifications are not published and must not be inferred.
- Returns, from the published [refund policy]({{ agents.store_url }}/pages/refund-policy): orders paid by PayPal can be returned within 14 days of delivery if the item is unworn, unwashed and still has its tags and packaging. With cash on delivery the buyer opens and checks the item at the door and does not pay if it is not right; once a COD item is paid and accepted, the sale is final.
- Authenticity guarantee, from the same policy: if an item turns out not to be authentic, the buyer is refunded in full, whether they paid by PayPal or cash on delivery. The buyer sends photos of the item and its label on WhatsApp.
- Authenticity checks are an internal review by Lbass Original (label, model code when there is one, stitching, materials and details, compared with the brand's official data), not an external certificate. A doubtful piece is not listed.

